      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAUA OF QUEENS (8) is a David Jones-trained newcomer by Fernando Bale out of Paua Of Janie. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Market moves likely to signal ability but profiles strongly for this. STILL THE SAME (1) boxed on the inside and gets chance to find form. Last time finished 5th on September 3 over 450m at Shepparton behind Creativity beaten 6 lengths (26.24) in a Maiden. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Key player if finds best. BRACKEN RAVEN (2) is yet to break through in six starts but has run a number of placings. Is racing well without winning placing at her last two starts. Well placed and gets her chance. BRACKEN GORDON (3) should be thereabouts.",
